    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nWith `nvim_create_user_command`, one may assign a completion function (`customlist`) directly via `opts.complete`. `vim.ui.input` doesn't have such luxury, one must use `v:lua-call` (the devil himself).\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n`vim.ui.input`'s opts.completion should accept being assigned directly to a function, where it'll have the `customlist` behavior.",
